  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "軟體框架設計",
    "sub_ename": "SOFTWARE FRAMEWORK DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "介紹如何透過物件導向技術開發軟體系統。本課程著重在設計部分，特別是介紹各種物件導向設計的設計樣式。透過設計樣式的學習，學生可以了解軟體設計的原則、物件的模組設計、與實作上的技巧。本課程同時會介紹廣為採用的設計語言：UML物件導向設計語言，讓學生應用設計語言來規劃系統的設計。",
    "describe_eh": "Introduce the approach to develop a software system with object oriented technologies. This course will focus on the object-oriented design, especially different types of design patterns. With the knowledge of design patterns, students will learn the software design principles, object modeling techniques and object implementation skills. This course also introduces the most popular design language- Unified Modeling Language. Students will learn how to use this design language to design a software system.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
